LESSONS LEARNED

spells take 5*Lev Pw to cast (duh!)
"cone of cold"
  doesn't work when blind, SO CHECK before zapping (every time)
  doesn't work when you can see creature, but not the spot (dark corridor)
  doesn't work when engulfed (e.g. in an elemental)
    ..."The spell is cut short!"
when you hear rumbling (boulder trap), pay attention to boulders!
Sokoban
  nymphs can steal the (guaranteed) ?oEarth you're carrying, and read it...
create monster for sacfest
  ...can create multiple monsters around you
     ...and packs of creatures can spill over down the hall
     ...so make sure pets are close
  ...don't do it *on* the altar (can't engrave); do on a pre-engraved spot
magic traps
  can be "tower of flame erupts" (burns your scrolls potions & armor)
Jove says tripe ration in open inventory is "pet glue" :-)
watch where you /oDig in Minetown (if it touches shop, shopkeeper gets angry)
cobras drain strength; unihorn, as always, puts it back
